# Beast 3.0 External Relations & API Gateway Division

The External Relations & API Gateway Division serves as the secure communication bridge between the Beast 3.0 DAO ecosystem and external state agencies, oracle networks, and third-party services.

## Mission

Ensure secure, authenticated, and verified data exchange with external entities while protecting internal control planes from malicious ingress.

## Core Responsibilities

- Secure Webhook Management & Signature Verification
- External State Agency Data Cross-Streaming
- Third-Party Oracle Integration & Data Ingestion
- API Rate Limiting & Gateway Security

## Connected Systems

- Judicial & Audit Division (`div-03-judicial`)
- Cyber Security & Defense Division (`div-07-security-firewall`)
- System Orchestrator (`div-21-system-orchestrator`)

## Status

Development
